WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.444
Reading a balance.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.128
The Reference is the FMRA desk reference,

3
00:00:06.128 --> 00:00:09.366
inside Vantage, with every statement cited.

4
00:00:09.816 --> 00:00:11.758
Enter a document’s commitment,

5
00:00:11.758 --> 00:00:14.061
obligation, delivered, and paid.

6
00:00:14.816 --> 00:00:19.771
Vantage names the open condition, the causes worth ruling out,

7
00:00:19.771 --> 00:00:23.551
who can act, and what would prove the fix.

8
00:00:24.201 --> 00:00:27.653
A dash on a report isn’t a zero.

9
00:00:27.653 --> 00:00:29.839
Mark it not shown.

10
00:00:30.389 --> 00:00:34.114
Open a case, and the figures come with it,

11
00:00:34.114 --> 00:00:37.372
labelled with where they came from.
